Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le15ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: Look mom! I'm going to be a journalist!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: \u00a0What?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: \u00a0Well, it's not 100% sure yet, but it looks promising! You know I've been wanting to be a journalist for ages!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: Well, you've also talked a lot about being a scientist as well. I would keep my options open.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: \u00a0I've been in touch with the editors of <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>. I've also contacted one of their freelance journalists. They think I would be great as a journalist. They think I'm self-motivated, ambitious, a real go-getter!", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "34000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: That's great, honey, but you don't have any journalism experience. You could talk to a few more people first.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: I know. I've been planning to enrol in some courses for a while, and now I see there's a one-year program at Western College.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: Yes honey, but sometimes you tend to be shy and reserved around people. You're a bit of an introvert, darling. Maybe you should think a bit more about this idea. I wouldn't jump to any major decisions. \u00a0I see you more as a scientist.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "66000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Angela</span>: I've decided it would be boring to be a scientist. They have to be rational and logical all the time. Journalism sounds like a fascinating career. You get to travel all over the world!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Angela's mom</span>: Whatever you think, dear.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le15ob10re2img03.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob10re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}